          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "Shows an obtrusive banner over the video viewfinder - Camera app and Lock Screen quick-camera - whenever you're in video mode but **not actually recording**, so you never hold up your phone through an entire concert thinking you're filming it.\n\nAn independent, from-scratch reimplementation of [marcoroth's NotRecording](https://github.com/marcoroth/NotRecording), rebuilt for modern iOS and rootless jailbreaks."
